{"id":"4a8ce12d511e773a","group":"17","path":"17/17-df-filters.md","title":"Class of Filters","display":"df-filters — Class of Filters","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-df-filters","aliases":["17-df-filters"],"display":"df-filters — Class of Filters","depends_on":["[[17-df-filter]]"],"label_origin":"local-catalog","source_verification":"statement-compared; local set packaging; local empty-index extension","source_section":"4.1","source_result":"local set packaging of source filter definition","source_pages_print":[211,212],"source_pages_djvu":[227,228],"legacy_label":"17-df-4.1.1b"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-df-filters"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-df-filters</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-filters — Class of Filters"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"50a46bce013b2772\" href=\"?note=50a46bce013b2772\" title=\"17-df-filter\">17-df-filter</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"statement-compared; local set packaging; local empty-index extension"},{"key":"source_section","html":"4.1"},{"key":"source_result","html":"local set packaging of source filter definition"},{"key":"source_pages_print","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>211</span><span>212</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pages_djvu","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>227</span><span>228</span></div>"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-df-4.1.1b"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 是任意集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Filter}_I\">\\(\\operatorname{Filter}_I\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"50a46bce013b2772\" href=\"?note=50a46bce013b2772\" title=\"17-df-filter\">17-df-filter</a>，包括其中明确的空指标本地扩展。以下定义集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Filters}(I)\">\\(\\operatorname{Filters}(I)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Filters}(I)\\coloneqq\n\\{F\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(I)):\\operatorname{Filter}_I(F)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Filters}(I)\\coloneqq\n\\{F\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(I)):\\operatorname{Filter}_I(F)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是原书印刷 pp.211–212 滤子定义的集合包装；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(I)\\in\\operatorname{Filters}(I)\">\\(\\mathcal P(I)\\in\\operatorname{Filters}(I)\\)</span>。它是有界集合，标题沿用旧稿的 “Class of Filters” 术语，并非需要真类量化。原书没有单独给这个包装编号。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-filter","status":"resolved","id":"50a46bce013b2772","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-filter]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-filter","status":"resolved","id":"50a46bce013b2772","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$I$ 是任意集合，$\\operatorname{Filter}_I$ 见 [[17-df-filter]]，包括其中明确的空指标本地扩展。以下定义集合 $\\operatorname{Filters}(I)$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Filter}_I","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Filters}(I)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Filters}(I)\\coloneqq\n\\{F\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(I)):\\operatorname{Filter}_I(F)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"